                </l>
                <l>Defluit saxis agitatus <choice>
                        <abbr>humor</abbr>
                        <expan>humor</expan>
                    </choice>. <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">the turbulent water flows down
                        from the rocks,</seg>
                </l>
                <l>Concidunt venti, fugiunt <choice>
                        <abbr>q;</abbr>
                        <expan>que</expan>
                    </choice> nubes. <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">the winds die down, the
                        clouds flee.</seg>
                </l>
                <l> Et minax quia sic <choice>
                        <abbr>uoluere</abbr>
                        <expan>voluere</expan>
                    </choice> ponto unda <choice>
                        <abbr>recũbit</abbr>
                        <expan>recumbit</expan>
                    </choice>
                    <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the treatening wave, because they
