                </l>
                <seg xml:id="seg_S_1">S</seg>
                <l>
                    <seg xml:id="Romulus_post">
                        <rs key="Romulus">Romulum </rs> post</seg> hos prius an quietum <seg
                        type="translation" xml:lang="en">After these, I am in doubt whether to
                        recount Romulus first, or the quiet</seg>
                </l>
                <l>
                    <name key="Numa Pompilius">Pompilii </name> regnum memor et superbos <seg
                        type="translation" xml:lang="en">reign of Numa Pompilius or the proud</seg>
                </l>
                <seg xml:id="seg_trikolon_2">∵</seg>
                <note target="#seg_Romulus_post_1" type="addition">dubito</note>
                <seg xml:id="seg_pro_1">
                    <choice>
                        <abbr>ꝓ</abbr>
                        <expan>pro</expan>
                    </choice>
                </seg>
                <l>
                    <name key="Tarquinius">Tarquinii </name> fasces an <name key="Cato"
                        >Catonis</name> nobile letum. <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">fasces
