                        and the Scaurian name</seg>
                </l>
                <seg xml:id="seg_SS_1">SS</seg>
                <l>
                    <choice>
                        <abbr>ꝓdigum</abbr>
                        <expan>prodigum</expan>
                    </choice> paulum <choice>
                        <abbr>suꝑante</abbr>
                        <expan>superante</expan>
                    </choice>
                    <name key="Poeno">Poeno </name>
                    <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">and <name key="Paulus">Paulus</name>, when
                        the Carthaginian conquered,</seg>
                </l>
                <seg xml:id="seg_SSS_1">SSS</seg>
                <l> Gratus insigni referam <choice>
                        <abbr>camẽa</abbr>
                        <expan>camena</expan>
                    </choice>
                    <name key="Fabricius">Fabriciumque</name>
                    <seg type="translation" xml:lang="en">in a grateful song, and of
