                </l>
                <l>
                    <choice>
                        <abbr>Siue</abbr>
                        <expan>Sive</expan>
                    </choice> subiectos orientis orae <name key="Seres">Seras</name> et Indos. <seg
                        type="translation">or the Seres and Indians who live under the eastern
                        sky.</seg></l>
                <note target="#aequus_1" type="synonym">iustus</note>
                <l> Te minor Latium regit <seg xml:id="seg_aequus_1">aequus</seg> orbem. <seg
                        type="translation">He, being less than you, shall rule the wide world in
