                </l>
                <l> Tu <choice>
                        <abbr>graui</abbr>
                        <expan>gravi</expan>
                    </choice> curru quaties <name key="Olympus">Olympum.</name>
                    <seg type="translation">You shall shake Olympus with your heavy chariot,</seg>
                </l>
                <l> Tu parvum castis inimica mittes fulmina lucis. <seg type="translation">you shall
